</pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">argc</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">char</span> <span class="k">const</span> <span class="err">\</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="n">argv</span><span class="err">\</span><span class="p">[])</span>
<span class="p">{</span>
<span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">myString</span><span class="p">;</span>

<span class="n">cout</span> <span class="o">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="s">"input a string: "</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="n">getline</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">cin</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">myString</span><span class="p">);</span>
<span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">length</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">myString</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">length</span><span class="p">();</span>

<span class="kt">char</span> <span class="n">charArray</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="k">new</span> <span class="kt">char</span> <span class="err">\</span><span class="o">*</span> <span class="p">[</span><span class="n">length</span><span class="p">];</span>

<span class="n">charArray</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">myString</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="k">for</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">length</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="o">++</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">){</span>
<span class="n">cout</span> <span class="o">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="n">charArray</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class="s">" "</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="k">return</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>

<span class="p">}</span>
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></figure>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="sample-posts"/><category term="formatting"/><category term="code"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[一个带有代码块的博客示例]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">博客示例——图片</title><link href="https://yuanchengfang.github.io/zh-cn/blog/2015/images/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="博客示例——图片"/><published>2015-05-15T21:01:00+00:00</published><updated>2015-05-15T21:01:00+00:00</updated><id>https://yuanchengfang.github.io/blog/2015/images</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://yuanchengfang.github.io/blog/2015/images/"><![CDATA[<p>这是一个带有图片画廊的示例文章。</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/9-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/9-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/9-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/9.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/7-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/7-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/7-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/7.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="caption"> 一个简洁优雅的图片说明，可以放在图片行之间、每一行之后，当然也可以不写。 </div> <p>图片可以设置为可放大。<br/> 只需在你希望可放大的 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">&lt;img&gt;</code> 标签中添加 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">data-zoomable</code> 即可。</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/8-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/8-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/8-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/8.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/10-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/10-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/10-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/10.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>本文其余的图片都可以放大，并排布成不同的小型画廊。</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/11-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/11-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/11-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/11.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/12-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/12-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/12-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/12.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/7-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/7-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/7-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/7.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="sample-posts"/><category term="formatting"/><category term="images"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[包含多个图片的博客]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">博客示例——格式与链接</title><link href="https://yuanchengfang.github.io/zh-cn/blog/2015/formatting-and-links/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="博客示例——格式与链接"/><published>2015-03-15T16:40:16+00:00</published><updated>2015-03-15T16:40:16+00:00</updated><id>https://yuanchengfang.github.io/blog/2015/formatting-and-links</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://yuanchengfang.github.io/blog/2015/formatting-and-links/"><![CDATA[<p>“人生若只如初见，何事秋风悲画扇。”<br/> “采菊东篱下，悠然见南山。”<br/> “我思故我在。”<br/> “苟日新，日日新，又日新。”<br/> “学而不思则罔，思而不学则殆。” <a href="https://www.pinterest.com">Pinterest</a><br/> “千里之行，始于足下。”<br/> “但愿人长久，千里共婵娟。”<br/> “读书破万卷，下笔如有神。”<br/> “世间所有的相遇，都是久别重逢。”</p> <h4 id="名言清单">名言清单</h4> <ul> <li>天行健，君子以自强不息</li> <li>海内存知己，天涯若比邻</li> <li>路漫漫其修远兮，吾将上下而求索</li> <li>敏而好学，不耻下问</li> </ul> <h4 id="任务清单">任务清单</h4> <ul class="task-list"> <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" class="task-list-item-checkbox" disabled="disabled" checked="checked"/>刷牙</li> <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" class="task-list-item-checkbox" disabled="disabled"/>穿袜子 <ul class="task-list"> <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" class="task-list-item-checkbox" disabled="disabled" checked="checked"/>穿左脚袜</li> <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" class="task-list-item-checkbox" disabled="disabled"/>穿右脚袜</li> </ul> </li> <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" class="task-list-item-checkbox" disabled="disabled" checked="checked"/>去学校</li> </ul> <p>“长风破浪会有时，直挂云帆济沧海。”<br/> “己欲立而立人，己欲达而达人。”<br/> “纸上得来终觉浅，绝知此事要躬行。”<br/> “读万卷书，行万里路。”</p> <hr/> <p>“人生天地间，忽如远行客。”<br/> “临渊羡鱼，不如退而结网。”<br/> “有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎。”<br/> “千里莺啼绿映红，水村山郭酒旗风。”<br/> “欲穷千里目，更上一层楼。”</p> <blockquote> <p>我们的成长不是直线的。有时在一个方面成熟，却在另一个方面幼稚；我们是片段的，是不平衡的， 却因此保有无限的可能。<br/> — 改写自安娜伊丝·宁</p> </blockquote> <p>“横看成岭侧成峰，远近高低各不同。”<br/> “青山遮不住，毕竟东流去。”<br/> “知者不惑，仁者不忧，勇者不惧。”<br/> “先天下之忧而忧，后天下之乐而乐。”<br/> “桃李不言，下自成蹊。”</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="sample-posts"/><category term="formatting"/><category term="links"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[简要介绍怎么在博客中按格式排版与插入链接]]></summary></entry></feed>